ants without another table. The existing anchor state durably stores pending_rearm before venue cancellation and reveal_armed_at only after authenticated zero-fill cancellation returns REVEALED inventory to HIDDEN; no replacement-generation state or new table is used. Manual Rehide selects this same intent with reprice_reason=rehide and does not add a separate state machine. operator_cancel_requested_at independently persists intentional stop across completion/fills/restart; unresolved live exposure prevents destructive Clear All even when the local status is terminal.","tables":["stealth_orders"]}
