, plan: \"StealthMovePlan\") -> \"StealthMoveResult\":","excerpt_sha256":"589e74f40d7599866f4bc101e69e453f752e39f5fbc9e55699e8c7a3602038ce","file_sha256":"db773adc091496e6ff5eb8abadea01a9ffa1ea06632f28db6faa21868718c121","line_end":3826,"line_start":3411,"path":"core/stealth_order_manager.py","reviewed_scope_sha256":"589e74f40d7599866f4bc101e69e453f752e39f5fbc9e55699e8c7a3602038ce","symbol_id":"s:core/stealth_order_manager.py::StealthOrderManager.execute_stealth_move"},{"anchor":"def update_order_parent_execution_statuses(","excerpt_sha256":"f8960ef4029ca5aac8e8624335d96717b06a92a9a0130c2f51fe0b96eea12f1f","file_sha256":"d7f31810aad47db62d247644986123cb50da3658248fab4a10acd28295b2a29b","line_end":1283,"line_start":1086,"path":"database/order.py","reviewed_scope_sha256":"f8960ef4029ca5aac8e8624335d96717b06a92a9a0130c2f51fe0b96eea12f1f","symbol_id":"s:database/order.py::update_order_parent_execution_statuses"}],"id":"persist:stealth_placement_ownership","kind":"persistence","state":"verified_current","summary":"Every logical stealth order persists itself as execution owner, and every distinct reveal or manual-move placement persists the logical SID before its REST attempt. One atomic repository statement always writes exact placement truth and writes the owner only when it exists, owns itself, shares the same flat strategy root, and agrees with optional accepted-placement evidence. The in-memory accepted-placement index is a manager lookup/cross-check, may lag a pre-REST WebSocket event, and is restored only from persisted successful reveal evidence; rearm tombstones still prevent stale nonterminal resurrection.","tables":["order_parent","stealth_order_reveal_history","stealth_orders"],"tags":["stealth","ownership","restart"]}
